### Variables
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@module = student

### Login as superadmin (save the token for subsequent requests)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/loginUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "superadmin@test.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Login as school admin (save the token for subsequent requests)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/user/loginUser
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "schooladmin@test.com",
    "password": "password123"
}

### Create a new student
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/createStudent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "dateOfBirth": "2010-05-15",
    "gender": "male",
    "schoolId": "<your_school_id>",
    "classroomId": "<your_classroom_id>",
    "guardianInfo": {
        "name": "Jane Doe",
        "relationship": "mother",
        "contact": {
            "phone": "1234567890",
            "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
            "address": "123 Parent Street, City"
        }
    }
}

### Get a specific student
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/getStudent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "studentId": "<student_id>"
}

### List students (with optional filters)
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/listStudents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "schoolId": "<optional_school_id>",
    "classroomId": "<optional_classroom_id>"
}

### Update student details
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/updateStudent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "studentId": "<student_id>",
    "firstName": "John Updated",
    "lastName": "Doe Updated",
    "classroomId": "<new_classroom_id>",
    "guardianInfo": {
        "contact": {
            "phone": "9876543210"
        }
    }
}

### Transfer student to another school
PUT {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/transferStudent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "studentId": "<student_id>",
    "toSchoolId": "<target_school_id>",
    "reason": "Family relocation to new area"
}

### Delete a student (soft delete)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/deleteStudent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <your_token_here>

{
    "studentId": "<student_id>"
}

### Example Complete Workflow:

### 1. Create School (as superadmin)
POST {{baseUrl}}/school/createSchool
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <superadmin_token>

{
    "name": "Test School",
    "address": "123 Education St",
    "email": "test.school@example.com",
    "phone": "1234567890"
}

### 2. Create Classroom in that school
POST {{baseUrl}}/classroom/createClassroom
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <school_admin_token>

{
    "name": "Class 1A",
    "schoolId": "<school_id_from_step_1>",
    "capacity": 30,
    "grade": "1",
    "section": "A"
}

### 3. Enroll Student in the classroom
POST {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/createStudent
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <school_admin_token>

{
    "firstName": "John",
    "lastName": "Doe",
    "dateOfBirth": "2010-05-15",
    "gender": "male",
    "schoolId": "<school_id_from_step_1>",
    "classroomId": "<classroom_id_from_step_2>",
    "guardianInfo": {
        "name": "Jane Doe",
        "relationship": "mother",
        "contact": {
            "phone": "1234567890",
            "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
            "address": "123 Parent Street, City"
        }
    }
}

### 4. List Students in the classroom
GET {{baseUrl}}/{{module}}/listStudents
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <school_admin_token>

{
    "schoolId": "<school_id_from_step_1>",
    "classroomId": "<classroom_id_from_step_2>"
} 